// Raw Danger! (US): 60 steps a second (tools/rd_framerate.py --fps 60: each 20 -> 30 change snapped to its law, x1.5^n or x1.25^n, then x3^n).
// Tested: a 2 s walk after a fresh map load covers 3.60 m, as at 20, WITH the EE overclocked 2x (PS2_EE_OVERCLOCK=2); at 1 the step overran the vblank (48 steps a second, 2.85 m).
// EXPERIMENTAL and not offered by RawDangerPC.exe yet; code words (translate again); overlays not changed.
[60 steps a second (experimental; needs PS2_EE_OVERCLOCK=2)]
